Guard the Green Hills generator include in upstream bootstrap mode.

The current recipe uses the previous-stage CMake, not ./bootstrap, so
this guard is inactive in the normal package build. Review R8 tracks
whether this historical bootstrap-only patch is still worth retaining.

--- a/Source/cmake.cxx
+++ b/Source/cmake.cxx
@@ -129,7 +129,8 @@

 // NOTE: the __linux__ macro is predefined on Android host too, but
 // main CMakeLists.txt filters out this generator by host name.
-#if (defined(__linux__) && !defined(__ANDROID__)) || defined(_WIN32)
+#if !defined(CMAKE_BOOTSTRAP) && \
+    ((defined(__linux__) && !defined(__ANDROID__)) || defined(_WIN32))
 #  include "cmGlobalGhsMultiGenerator.h"
 #endif
